            "text": "###### **7.2 Participant Demographics for SPE Getting to Zero: The Road to Stavanger Sessions** \n\nSPE Getting to Zero: The Road to Stavanger sessions conducted across the globe were attended by more than 750 participants. During the interactive sessions, participants were asked to report their organizational affiliation and their employment position. The results are illustrated by the graphs below. \n\nOrganizational Affiliation of Participants \n\n\n\n<!-- Start of picture text -->\n7%<br>Vendor/Supplier<br>8%<br>Consultant<br>14% Oil Company<br>46%<br>Academia<br>3%<br>Government<br>1%<br>Service Company<br>18% Drilling Company<br><!-- End of picture text -->\n\n**Fig. 9—Organizational affiliation of participants of the SPE Getting to Zero sessions.** \n\nEmployment Position of Participants \n\n\n\n<!-- Start of picture text -->\n5%<br>Engineering/<br>Technical<br>14% Operations<br>24%<br>Environment<br>6%<br>General HSE<br>28%<br>Safety<br><!-- End of picture text -->\n\n**Fig. 10—Employment positions of participants of the SPE Getting to Zero sessions.** \n\n**SPE Technical Report** • Getting to Zero and Beyond: The Path Forward \n\n31 \n\n",
            "markdown": "###### **7.2 Participant Demographics for SPE Getting to Zero: The Road to Stavanger Sessions** \n\nSPE Getting to Zero: The Road to Stavanger sessions conducted across the globe were attended by more than 750 participants. During the interactive sessions, participants were asked to report their organizational affiliation and their employment position. The results are illustrated by the graphs below. \n\nOrganizational Affiliation of Participants \n\n\n\n<!-- Start of picture text -->\n7%<br>Vendor/Supplier<br>8%<br>Consultant<br>14% Oil Company<br>46%<br>Academia<br>3%<br>Government<br>1%<br>Service Company<br>18% Drilling Company<br><!-- End of picture text -->\n\n**Fig. 9—Organizational affiliation of participants of the SPE Getting to Zero sessions.** \n\nEmployment Position of Participants \n\n\n\n<!-- Start of picture text -->\n5%<br>Engineering/<br>Technical<br>14% Operations<br>24%<br>Environment<br>6%<br>General HSE<br>28%<br>Safety<br><!-- End of picture text -->\n\n**Fig. 10—Employment positions of participants of the SPE Getting to Zero sessions.** \n\n**SPE Technical Report** • Getting to Zero and Beyond: The Path Forward \n\n31 \n\n",
